        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "description": "Across the selected nodes, weighted by job: total worker time over successful transcodes in the last 24h divided by their count. One worker's time, not the farm's: with N workers busy, files finish N times as often."
